## Directory layout

<!--
  A literal `tree -L 2 -d` output, edited to comment each top-level entry.
  Judge A05 reads this and compares to the actual layout — keep it current.
-->

```
{{project_name}}/
├── src/                     # [what lives here]
├── tests/                   # [unit test root]
│   ├── unit/
│   ├── integration/         # separately named; see D11
│   └── ...
├── e2e-tests/               # end-to-end tests (Playwright / Cypress / ...)
├── docs/
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md      # this file
│   ├── DEVELOPMENT.md       # local dev workflow
│   ├── TESTING.md           # test strategy + AI-legibility guidance
│   ├── PRECOMMIT.md         # hook configuration and troubleshooting
│   ├── specs/               # SDD artifacts (specs, tasks, questions)
│   └── decisions/           # ADRs — see below
├── .claude/                 # agent settings + reusable workflows
├── .devcontainer/           # reproducible dev environment
├── .github/workflows/       # CI gates
└── scripts/                 # onboarding + operational scripts
```

